    id: '998', slug: 'i-can-quit-whenever-i-want-2-masterclass', title: 'I Can Quit Whenever I Want 2: Masterclass', title_ar: 'Smetto quando voglio - Masterclass', year: 2017,
    director: 'Sydney Sibilia', director_ar: 'Sydney Sibilia',
    cast: ['Edoardo Leo', 'Valerio Aprea', 'Stefano Fresi', 'Paolo Calabresi', 'Libero De Rienzo', 'Lorenzo Lavia'],
    genres: ['action', 'comedy', 'crime'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBQgBWtDym6E7Qem6uhbWJUUHW8.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/croyOm5E0cv5DQkdAx60YLtGg2X.jpg',
    description_ar: 'Pietro Zinni is asked by the police to revive the old gang to create a task force that will stop the spread of smart drugs.',
    description_en: 'Pietro Zinni is asked by the police to revive the old gang to create a task force that will stop the spread of smart drugs.',
    description_fr: 'Pietro Zinni is asked by the police to revive the old gang to create a task force that will stop the spread of smart drugs.',
    description_es: 'La banda del neurobiólogo Pietro y sus cultos compañeros se enriquece con nuevos integrantes, los llamados cerebros en fuga, en una misión que los llevará a ser “el brazo universitario de la ley”. El grupo se ve obligado a cambiar de bando: a cambio de un expediente limpio de antecedentes policiales, deberá colaborar en secreto con la policía para acabar con la propagación de las nuevas drogas, bajo las órdenes de la ambiciosa inspectora Paola Coletti.',
    description_tr: 'Pietro Zinni is asked by the police to revive the old gang to create a task force that will stop the spread of smart drugs.',
