    id: '1284', slug: 'oss-117-cairo-nest-of-spies', title: 'OSS 117: Cairo, Nest of Spies', title_ar: 'OSS 117 : Le Caire, nid d\'espions', year: 2006,
    director: 'Michel Hazanavicius', director_ar: 'Michel Hazanavicius',
    cast: ['Jean Dujardin', 'Bérénice Bejo', 'Aure Atika', 'Philippe Lefebvre', 'Konstantin Aleksandrov', 'Saïd Amadis'],
    genres: ['crime', 'action', 'adventure'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDVHVZVEbTV4JsB8ZjdXNmMK7rA.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mrRzR4Xbt64heUQF5YBMMfdMEXu.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HYobrwvSs9Q',
    description_ar: 'Set in 1955, French secret agent Hubert Bonisseur de La Bath/OSS 117 is sent to Cairo to investigate the disappearance of his best friend and fellow spy Jack Jefferson, only to stumble into a web of international intrigue.',
    description_en: 'Set in 1955, French secret agent Hubert Bonisseur de La Bath/OSS 117 is sent to Cairo to investigate the disappearance of his best friend and fellow spy Jack Jefferson, only to stumble into a web of international intrigue.',
    description_fr: 'Égypte, 1955, le Caire est un véritable nid d’espions. Tout le monde se méfie de tout le monde, tout le monde complote contre tout le monde : Anglais, Français, Soviétiques, la famille du Roi déchu Farouk qui veut retrouver son trône, les Aigles de Khéops, secte religieuse qui veut prendre le pouvoir. Le Président de la République Française, Monsieur René Coty, envoie son arme maîtresse mettre de l’ordre dans cette pétaudière au bord du chaos : Hubert Bonisseur de la Bath, dit OSS 117.',
    description_es: 'Egipto, 1955. El Cairo es un verdadero nido de espías. Nadie confía en nadie, todos conspiran contra todos: ingleses, franceses, soviéticos, la familia del rey Farouk que quiere recuperar el trono, las Águilas de Keops, secta religiosa que quiere tomar el poder... Para acabar con esta situación caótica, René Coty, el Presidente de la República francesa, envía al mejor agente francés: Hubert Bonisseur de la Bath, conocido como OSS 117 (Jean Dujardin).',
    description_tr: 'Fransız gizli servisinin müthiş başarılı, bir o kadar esprili, kadınlar için çekici ve aynı zamanda çok zeki ajanı Hubert \'OSS 117\'ye (Jean Dujardin) hükümeti tarafından çok önemli bir görev verilir. Mısırda kendisinden haber alınamayan arkadaşı ajan Jack\'in ortağı olarak bir iş adamı kılığında Mısır\'a gidecektir. Burada Amerikalılarla Ruslar mücadele içinde, İngilizler Süveys kanalı üzerinde hak iddia etmekte, kökten dinciler ise terör estirmektedir. Oss 117, Jack\'e ne olduğunu anlamak, ülkede barışı sağlamak ve Orta Doğuyu güvenli bir hale getirmek üzere adeta bir casus yuvası halindeki Mısır\'a doğru yola çıkar.',
    description_de: 'Ägypten 1955: Kairo ist ein Schmelztiegel, in dem Geheimagenten aus aller Herren Länder unterwegs sind. Jeder spioniert gegen jeden, jeder sabotiert jeden: Franzosen, Engländer, Sowjets, die Familie des gestürzten Königs Farouk sowie islamische Extremisten. Um wieder Ordnung in das Chaos zu bringen und eine geheime Mission zu erfüllen, entsendet der französische Präsident seine ultimative Geheimwaffe, den Stolz des Geheimdienstes, den Helden Europas, in den Hexenkessel Nordafrikas: Hubert Bonisseur de La Bath, alias OSS 117!',
    description_ja: 'Set in 1955, French secret agent Hubert Bonisseur de La Bath/OSS 117 is sent to Cairo to investigate the disappearance of his best friend and fellow spy Jack Jefferson, only to stumble into a web of international intrigue.',
    description_pt: 'Set in 1955, French secret agent Hubert Bonisseur de La Bath/OSS 117 is sent to Cairo to investigate the disappearance of his best friend and fellow spy Jack Jefferson, only to stumble into a web of international intrigue.',
    rating_overall: 7.3, rating_story: 7.3, rating_acting: 7.4, rating_direction: 7.2, rating_cinematography: 7, rating_music: 6.8,
    imdb_rating: 7.2, rotten_tomatoes: 72,
    budget_million: 15.2,
    box_office_million: 23,
    duration: 99, language: 'FR', country: 'FR',
    reviews_count: 5826, is_featured: false, release_date: '2006-04-19', tags: ['crime', 'action', 'adventure', '2006', 'hazanavicius'],
    pros_ar: ['إثارة وأكشن مبهر', 'مؤثرات بصرية رائعة', 'إيقاع سريع وممتع'],
