    id: '1288', slug: 'man-bites-dog', title: 'Man Bites Dog', title_ar: 'C\'est arrivé près de chez vous', year: 1992,
    director: 'Rémy Belvaux', director_ar: 'Rémy Belvaux',
    cast: ['Benoît Poelvoorde', 'Rémy Belvaux', 'André Bonzel', 'Jacqueline Poelvoorde-Pappaert', 'Valérie Parent', 'Édith Le Merdy'],
    genres: ['comedy', 'crime'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRVI98a6MxdLkpsXM8LqIM9W7XZ.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7QLGk7qKm66dtjTtpVeAIRocoan.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3HFuTY3HpV8',
    description_ar: 'The activities of rampaging, indiscriminate serial killer Ben are recorded by a willingly complicit documentary team, who eventually become his accomplices and active participants. Ben provides casual commentary on the nature of his work and arbitrary musings on topics of interest to him, such as music or the conditions of low-income housing, and even goes so far as to introduce the documentary crew to his family. But their reckless indulgences soon get the better of them.',
    description_en: 'The activities of rampaging, indiscriminate serial killer Ben are recorded by a willingly complicit documentary team, who eventually become his accomplices and active participants. Ben provides casual commentary on the nature of his work and arbitrary musings on topics of interest to him, such as music or the conditions of low-income housing, and even goes so far as to introduce the documentary crew to his family. But their reckless indulgences soon get the better of them.',
    description_fr: 'Une équipe de tournage suit un voleur impitoyable et tueur sans cœur, mais les complications surviennent lorsque l\'équipe du film perd son objectivité et commence à l\'aider dans ses tâches quotidiennes.',
    description_es: 'Un asesino en serie y ladrón es seguido a todas horas por un equipo de televisión que registra todas sus reflexiones para mostrarlas en un documental, al tiempo que el psicópata prosigue con sus criminales actividades.',
    description_tr: 'Belçikalı 3 sinema öğrencisinin yönettiği “C’est arrivé près de chez vous”, bir katil olan Benoit’nın hayatından kesitler sunan bir kurmaca belgeseldir (mockumentary). Remy, Andre ve Patrick adında üç sinema öğrencisi ödev olarak Benoit’nın günlük yaşamını ve günlük yaşamın parçası olan cinayet alışkanlığını filme almak isterler.  Zaman ilerledikçe farkederler ki Benoit, diğer katillerden farklıdır. Zeki, entelektüel ve sosyal bir insandır, oldukça normal bir yaşamı ve mutlu bir ailesi vardır. Bir yandan bütün olağanlığı ile Benoit\'nın günlerini ve işlediği cinayetleri filme alan ekip, diğer yandan bu cinayetlerin bazılarına yardım ederler...',
    description_de: 'Ein Kamerateam begleitet den Killer Ben bei der Arbeit. Launig berichtet er über seinen Job und sein Leben. Bald weicht die anfängliche Distanz der Reporter der Kumpanei mit dem Mörder. Schließlich helfen sie sogar bei der Beseitigung der Leichen und legen selbst Hand an...',
    description_ja: 'The activities of rampaging, indiscriminate serial killer Ben are recorded by a willingly complicit documentary team, who eventually become his accomplices and active participants. Ben provides casual commentary on the nature of his work and arbitrary musings on topics of interest to him, such as music or the conditions of low-income housing, and even goes so far as to introduce the documentary crew to his family. But their reckless indulgences soon get the better of them.',
    description_pt: 'As actividades de Ben, um assassino em série que mata de modo indiscriminado, são registadas por uma equipa de documentários que, eventualmente, se torna cúmplice e participante dos seus crimes. Ben faz comentários casuais sobre a natureza do seu trabalho e reflexões arbitrárias sobre temas do seu interesse, como música ou as condições de vida dos mais pobres.',
    rating_overall: 7.4, rating_story: 7.3, rating_acting: 7.4, rating_direction: 7.2, rating_cinematography: 7, rating_music: 6.8,
    imdb_rating: 7.2, rotten_tomatoes: 72,
    budget_million: 0.0,
    box_office_million: 0,
    duration: 96, language: 'FR', country: 'BE',
    reviews_count: 2324, is_featured: false, release_date: '1992-08-20', tags: ['comedy', 'crime', '1992', 'belvaux'],
    pros_ar: ['إخراج متميز', 'قصة مشوقة', 'أداء رائع للممثلين'],
    cons_ar: ['وتيرة بطيئة في بعض المشاهد', 'يحتاج تركيزاً عالياً'],
